        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By offering liquidity in both hard-currency and local currency emerging market debt, we have created an efficient emerging market trading ecosystem for all of our channels.",
        "start_character": 17114,
        "end_character": 17286
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-067009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-067009-3d56c65b0f86c540",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-067009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Following the introduction of Open Trading on our platforms in 2013, we have continued to build upon the technology to develop more features and services.",
