        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are increasingly striving to be “protocol-agnostic” by offering a broad suite of trading protocols and execution tools to meet the needs of our clients’ evolving requirements across market cycles.",
